[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早饭还是老朋友杯面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吸吮着乌冬面的声音，回响在清晨的加藤家餐桌上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，对了对了，羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11635"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“关于之前那本书。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……书？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11632"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……漫画？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我有借给过镜子阿姨吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不是那个，是之前在仓库里和标本一起的古书。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是那本啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我正在翻译成现代文，大概今天就能完成。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的吗！谢谢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍对这本记载了七影蝶相关信息的古书也很感兴趣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她现在所做的事，如果我能帮上点忙就好了。"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]